@startuml
[*] --> TaskCreated
TaskCreated --> InProgress : Mark In Progress
TaskCreated --> OnHold : Mark On Hold
TaskCreated --> Cancelled : Cancel Task
InProgress --> NearDueDate : Approaching Due Date
InProgress --> Overdue : Pass Due Date
InProgress --> Completed : Complete Task
NearDueDate --> Overdue : Pass Due Date
NearDueDate --> Completed : Complete Task
Overdue --> Completed : Complete Task
Overdue --> Cancelled : Cancel Task
OnHold --> InProgress : Resume Task
OnHold --> Cancelled : Cancel Task
Completed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
